OL,3,AFaisal Islam: The two big decisions the
OL,4,Achancellor must make
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is tough," John Healey admitted to
OL,7,Fme earlier this month when I asked him
OL,8,Fif there had been too much
OL,9,Fdoom-mongering?
OL,11,F"Conflicts, uncertainty, driving up
OL,12,Finflation, driving up interest rates.
OL,13,FBut we've got great strengths. We've
OL,14,Fgot good reasons to be confident about
OL,15,Fthe future of Britain," he insisted.
OL,17,FThe new scheme to try and help young
OL,18,Fpeople get on the property ladder,
OL,19,Fannounced on Saturday, was aimed at
OL,20,Fboosting confidence in the economy.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
